      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pharmacologic tests with i.v. dipyridamole were performed in 192 patients between 18 and 65 years of age, for purposes of differential diagnosis between angina and cardiology; bicycle ergometry was carried out in 167 of those. The results of the two tests proved identical, as shown by electrocardiographic evidence of myocardial ischemia."},
